{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-card",
  "category": "layout",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-card&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente iswc-card de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-card",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Contenedor flexible con slots para <code class=\"code\">media</code>, <code class=\"code\">header</code>,\r\n          <code class=\"code\">body</code>, <code class=\"code\">footer</code> y <code class=\"code\">actions</code>.\r\n          Cinco apariencias y dos orientaciones. JavaScript nativo, Shadow DOM, sin frameworks.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<span class=\"demo-label\">caso mínimo</span>\r\n          <iswc-card>Hola mundo</iswc-card>",
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:variant",
              "label": "variant",
              "options": [
                "accent",
                "filled",
                "outlined",
                "filled-outlined",
                "plain"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-card>Hola mundo</iswc-card>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "appearances",
      "title": "Apariencias",
      "lede": "El atributo <code class=\"code\">appearance</code> define el tratamiento visual.\r\n          Default: <code class=\"code\">outlined</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"card-grid\">\r\n          <iswc-card variant=\"outlined\">\r\n            <strong>outlined</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"card-meta\">Borde 1px, fondo transparente.</p>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n          <iswc-card variant=\"filled\">\r\n            <strong>filled</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"card-meta\">Fondo elevado, sin borde.</p>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n          <iswc-card variant=\"filled-outlined\">\r\n            <strong>filled-outlined</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"card-meta\">Fondo + borde.</p>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n          <iswc-card variant=\"plain\">\r\n            <strong>plain</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"card-meta\">Sin fondo ni borde, solo espaciado.</p>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n          <iswc-card variant=\"accent\">\r\n            <strong>accent</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"card-meta\">Borde lateral de color de marca.</p>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-card variant=\"accent\">...</iswc-card>\n<iswc-card variant=\"filled-outlined\">...</iswc-card>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vertical-full",
      "title": "Vertical con header, media y footer",
      "lede": "Composición vertical completa. El slot <code class=\"code\">media</code> va arriba,\r\n          <code class=\"code\">header</code> debajo, <code class=\"code\">body</code> en el centro y\r\n          <code class=\"code\">footer</code> al final.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"card-stage-h\">\r\n          <iswc-card style=\"max-width: 360px; width: 100%;\">\r\n            <div slot=\"media\">\r\n              <div class=\"card-demo-img\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mockup\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div slot=\"header\"><strong>Notificación importante</strong></div>\r\n            <p>Hemos detectado actividad inusual en tu cuenta. Revisa los detalles y confirma si fuiste tú.</p>\r\n            <div slot=\"footer\" class=\"card-row-actions\">\r\n              <iswc-button color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\">Más tarde</iswc-button>\r\n              <iswc-button color=\"brand\">Revisar</iswc-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-card>\n  <div slot=\"media\"><img src=\"...\" alt=\"...\"/></div>\n  <div slot=\"header\">Título</div>\n  Contenido del body.\n  <div slot=\"footer\">\n    <iswc-button>Cancelar</iswc-button>\n    <iswc-button color=\"brand\">Aceptar</iswc-button>\n  </div>\n</iswc-card>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "horizontal",
      "title": "Horizontal",
      "lede": "Con <code class=\"code\">orientation=\"horizontal\"</code> el card se vuelve una fila:\r\n          <code class=\"code\">media</code> a la izquierda, <code class=\"code\">body</code> crece, <code class=\"code\">actions</code> a la derecha.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"card-stage-h\">\r\n          <iswc-card orientation=\"horizontal\" style=\"max-width: 560px; width: 100%;\">\r\n            <div slot=\"media\">\r\n              <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:bell-ring-outline\" style=\"font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--iswc-accent);\"></iswc-icon>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div>\r\n              <strong>Nueva mención</strong>\r\n              <p class=\"card-meta\">Te han mencionado en <code>#general</code> hace 3 min.</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div slot=\"actions\" class=\"card-row-actions\">\r\n              <iswc-button color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">Ignorar</iswc-button>\r\n              <iswc-button color=\"brand\">Ver</iswc-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-card orientation=\"horizontal\">\n  <iswc-icon slot=\"media\" icon=\"mdi:bell\"></iswc-icon>\n  <strong>Nueva mención</strong>\n  <div slot=\"actions\"><iswc-button>Ver</iswc-button></div>\n</iswc-card>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "header-footer-actions",
      "title": "Header / footer con acciones",
      "lede": "Slots <code class=\"code\">header-actions</code> y <code class=\"code\">footer-actions</code>\r\n          reservan un extremo del header/footer para botones o iconos.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"card-stage-h\">\r\n          <iswc-card style=\"max-width: 420px; width: 100%;\">\r\n            <div slot=\"header\"><strong>Proyecto InSoft</strong></div>\r\n            <div slot=\"header-actions\">\r\n              <iswc-button color=\"neutral\" variant=\"plain\" pill title=\"Más opciones\">\r\n                <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:dots-horizontal\"></iswc-icon>\r\n              </iswc-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <p>Repositorio privado con 3 issues abiertos y 12 PRs en revisión.</p>\r\n            <div slot=\"footer\" class=\"card-meta\">Actualizado hace 2 horas</div>\r\n            <div slot=\"footer-actions\">\r\n              <iswc-button color=\"brand\" variant=\"outlined\">Ver repo</iswc-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<iswc-card>\n  <strong slot=\"header\">Título</strong>\n  <iswc-button slot=\"header-actions\">...</iswc-button>\n  Contenido.\n  <span slot=\"footer\">Meta</span>\n  <iswc-button slot=\"footer-actions\">CTA</iswc-button>\n</iswc-card>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "methods",
      "title": "API JavaScript",
      "lede": "Como cualquier custom element, accedes con <code class=\"code\">document.querySelector('iswc-card')</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Propiedad",
            "Tipo",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>appearance</code>",
              "accent · filled · outlined · filled-outlined · plain",
              "Tratamiento visual (atributo reflected)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>orientation</code>",
              "horizontal · vertical",
              "Layout del card (atributo reflected)."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h4>Demo en vivo</h4>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<span class=\"demo-label\">cambia propiedades</span>\r\n          <iswc-card id=\"apiCard\" variant=\"outlined\">\r\n            <strong id=\"apiLabel\">Hola</strong>\r\n            <p class=\"card-meta\">Cambia appearance / orientation desde los botones.</p>\r\n          </iswc-card>\r\n          <div class=\"demo-row\" style=\"margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\r\n            <iswc-button id=\"apiOutlined\"  color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">outlined</iswc-button>\r\n            <iswc-button id=\"apiFilled\"    color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">filled</iswc-button>\r\n            <iswc-button id=\"apiFilledOut\"  color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">filled-outlined</iswc-button>\r\n            <iswc-button id=\"apiAccent\"     color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">accent</iswc-button>\r\n            <iswc-button id=\"apiPlain\"      color=\"neutral\" variant=\"outlined\">plain</iswc-button>\r\n            <iswc-button id=\"apiOrient\"     color=\"brand\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle orientation</iswc-button>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"log\" id=\"apiLog\" aria-live=\"polite\" style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\r\n            <div class=\"row hint\">El log aparece al cambiar appearance u orientation.</div>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "const c = document.querySelector('iswc-card');\nc.variant = 'filled';\nc.orientation = 'horizontal';\nc.addEventListener('slotchange', e => this.log(e));"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia completa",
      "blocks": [
